  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "35",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 35"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "35",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "A Psalm",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of David.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Plead",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "my cause",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", with them that strive with me: fight against them that fight against me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Take hold of shield and buckler, and stand up for mine help.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Draw out also the spear, and stop",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "the way",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "against them that persecute me: say unto my soul, I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy salvation.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let them be confounded and put to shame that seek after my soul: let them be turned back and brought to confusion that devise my hurt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let them be as chaff before the wind: and let the angel of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chase",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let their way be dark and slippery: and let the angel of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "persecute them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For without cause have they hid for me their net",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "in",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a pit,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "without cause they have digged for my soul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let destruction come upon him at unawares; and let his net that he hath hid catch himself: into that very destruction let him fall.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And my soul shall be joyful in the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": it shall rejoice in his salvation.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All my bones shall say,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", who",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "like unto thee, which deliverest the poor from him that is too strong for him, yea, the poor and the needy from him that spoileth him?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "False witnesses did rise up; they laid to my charge",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that I knew not.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They rewarded me evil for good",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "to",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the spoiling of my soul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But as for me, when they were sick, my clothing",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sackcloth: I humbled my soul with fasting; and my prayer returned into mine own bosom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I behaved myself as though",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "he had been",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my friend",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "or",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "brother: I bowed down heavily, as one that mourneth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "for his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mother.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But in mine adversity they rejoiced, and gathered themselves together:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "yea",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", the abjects gathered themselves together against me, and I knew",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not; they did tear",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "me",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and ceased not:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "With hypocritical mockers in feasts, they gnashed upon me with their teeth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lord, how long wilt thou look on? rescue my soul from their destructions, my darling from the lions.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will give thee thanks in the great congregation: I will praise thee among much people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let not them that are mine enemies wrongfully rejoice over me:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "neither",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "let them wink with the eye that hate me without a cause.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For they speak not peace: but they devise deceitful matters against",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them that are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "quiet in the land.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea, they opened their mouth wide against me,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said, Aha, aha, our eye hath seen",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "This",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou hast seen, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": keep not silence: O Lord, be not far from me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Stir up thyself, and awake to my judgment,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unto my cause, my God and my Lord.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Judge me, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my God, according to thy righteousness; and let them not rejoice over me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let them not say in their hearts, Ah, so would we have it: let them not say, We have swallowed him up.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let them be ashamed and brought to confusion together that rejoice at mine hurt: let them be clothed with shame and dishonour that magnify",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "themselves",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "against me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let them shout for joy, and be glad, that favour my righteous cause: yea, let them say continually, Let the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "be magnified, which hath pleasure in the prosperity of his servant.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 35:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And my tongue shall speak of thy righteousness",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.35.28",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.35.28"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of thy praise all the day long.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.35.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.35.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
